{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Knight of Xoroth: Hellborn rolls per AoE enemy hit at the Demon's Blood cap (#12238)",
  "contract": [
    "Hellborn 707840 reads 'Generating a stack of Demon's Blood now has a 10% chance to unleash your active Pestilence",
    "at half of their effectiveness' (installed Spell.dbc ProcChance 10). Bloodied Blade 800997 reads 'Melee Physical",
    "damage dealt now generates a stack of Demon's Blood' (spell_proc chance 100, no cooldown). #12238 reports that at",
    "the Demon's Blood cap an AoE physical hit rolls Hellborn once per cast instead of once per enemy hit. Brimstone",
    "Bludgeon 520005 hits the target and every enemy within 8 yd (SpellRadius 195), so ten enemies packed within",
    "4.5 yd give ten Bloodied Blade generations per cast. Each generation casts Demon's Blood 800999 on the knight and",
    "rolls Hellborn, so the 800999 cast count rises by one per enemy hit whether or not the aura is already capped.",
    "Every Bludgeon also unleashes the active Pestilence of War 802345 once on cast, landing Unleash War 802855 on",
    "all ten enemies (10 yd, at most 10 targets); each Hellborn proc unleashes it again on the same ten. The control",
    "cast without Hellborn fixes that base at 10 casts of 802855 per Bludgeon. Thirty capped casts make 300 Hellborn",
    "rolls: expected 30 procs, and the assertion requires at least 12 (300 + 120 Unleash War casts above the base),",
    "which per-hit rolling misses with probability below 1e-4 (P[Bin(300,0.1) <= 11]) while one roll per cast",
    "(Bin(30,0.1)) reaches it with probability below 2e-5."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 240000,
  "players": [
